# Dropdowns

Never use a native `<select>` for an openable list. OS option menus break the design system.

Use `app/ui/dropdown.tsx` (`import { Dropdown } from "@/app/ui/dropdown"`). Visual rules and CSS live in `DESIGN.md` under Dropdowns. Do not invent another menu style.
